📄 DocVerse AI
🚀 Upload Documents • Ask Questions • Get AI-Powered Answers

DocVerse AI is an intelligent Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) application that allows users to upload PDF documents and interact with them through natural language conversations.

Built using FastAPI, LangChain, ChromaDB, Sentence Transformers, Groq LLM, and Streamlit.

https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.10+-blue?style=for-the-badge&logo=python https://img.shields.io/badge/FastAPI-Framework-green?style=for-the-badge&logo=fastapi https://img.shields.io/badge/LangChain-RAG-orange?style=for-the-badge https://img.shields.io/badge/VectorDB-ChromaDB-purple?style=for-the-badge https://img.shields.io/badge/Frontend-Streamlit-red?style=for-the-badge&logo=streamlit

🌟 Features

✅ Upload PDF documents

✅ Extract and process text automatically

✅ Semantic search using embeddings

✅ Context-aware AI answers using RAG

✅ FastAPI backend with REST APIs

✅ Streamlit interactive user interface

✅ Conversation history support

✅ Open-source and free to use

